{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bloodfang</i> is a <strong>Soulslike action RPG</strong> set in a dark fantasy world ruled by beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/69fffc1382083dd7b7eeba1b4ce0ade8.poster.avif?t=1761498910\" width=1000 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/69fffc1382083dd7b7eeba1b4ce0ade8.webm?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/69fffc1382083dd7b7eeba1b4ce0ade8.mp4?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world ravaged by an ancient conflict between two creator goddesses, the harmony of nature was shattered. Their creations, prey and predators, waged an endless war, and the blood of that battle stained the land for ages. When silence finally fell, only the predators remained\u2026 and the balance vanished with them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precise and Challenging Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/8fa8a34ca0516df4cd8b227d635f3584.poster.avif?t=1761498910\" width=1000 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/8fa8a34ca0516df4cd8b227d635f3584.webm?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/8fa8a34ca0516df4cd8b227d635f3584.mp4?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the rhythm of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodfang\u2019s combat system demands skill and strategy, every strike counts, and a single mistake can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face each fight with courage, adapting to the style of every opponent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harness the Power of Emotion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.poster.avif?t=1761498910\" width=900 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.webm?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/ac6e90d25aa4e1edba96decc9fdd2226.mp4?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thalios\u2019 strength comes from bad Emotions.   <br>Rage, sorrow, fear, each emotion fuels his combat abilities in unique ways.  <br>Unleash your <strong>emotional power </strong>to gain temporary boosts or devastating attacks, but beware, losing control can turn the tide against you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Emotion will have its unique way to build up ( Rage will build up by taking damage )</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotions Skills will often change the enemies behaviors, making them more agressive or stronger.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/552e9f8aa3f93eef56b62d37fdcbcd03.poster.avif?t=1761498910\" width=1000 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/552e9f8aa3f93eef56b62d37fdcbcd03.webm?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/extras/552e9f8aa3f93eef56b62d37fdcbcd03.mp4?t=1761498910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area in <strong>Bloodfang</strong> is crafted to reward curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark forests, forgotten temples, and ancient ruins, uncovering secrets, shortcuts, and hidden rewards in every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attention and patience are your greatest weapons, the world is dangerous, but full of possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > In Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in intensive production, <strong>Bloodfang</strong> is being developed with a focus on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refined combat and animation mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansion of areas and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implementation of a playable demo for the community</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist to stay updated on upcoming news, trailers, and devlogs!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823660?t=1761498910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823660?t=1761498910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/bbaa0d686cc8c60e5a23b3c5ce56b5ef43d40741/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761498910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823660/bbaa0d686cc8c60e5a23b3c5ce56b5ef43d40741/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761498910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"F